  <p id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001:m0000" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">明敬劉皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001:m0006" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">惠端</persName>，彭城人，光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001:m0017" ref="vus_7f1_rrz">道弘</persName>孫也。<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001:m0022" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">高帝</persName>為明帝納之。建元三年，除西昌侯夫人。永明七年卒，葬江乘縣張山。延興元年，贈宣城王妃。明帝即位，追尊敬皇后。贈父通直郎<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001:m0082" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6">景猷</persName>為金紫光祿大夫，母<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan:p001:m0093" ref="q20_pas_ain">王氏</persName>平陽鄉君。明帝崩，改葬，祔于興安陵。</p>
</text>
